# expect: Ptr<i32>(0xf4240)
# expect: Ptr<i32>(0x0)
# Stage 5 polish: typed pointers print as "Ptr<T>(0xADDR)" rather than
# the raw u64 bits. Address is hex (no leading zeros), pointee name
# follows the [Ptr T] annotation.
def u64 addr 1000000
def [Ptr i32] p [ptr-cast [Ptr i32] $addr]
print $p
def [Ptr i32] np [ptr-null [Ptr i32]]
print $np
